- 1 You can now use Void points, which allow you to call on your inner strength and overcome impossible odds. While making a check, when assembling the dice pool you may spend 1 Void point to Seize the Moment! This allows you to roll 1 additional (ring) ring die and then keep 1 additional die (of any type) when resolving the check.
